FEFeatures => Customize FE exclusive features and visual settings.
pauseType => Choose which pause menu style to use during gameplay.
coolBackdrop => Enable a dynamic animated background for the pause menu.
showMS => Display real-time frame delay (milliseconds) on screen.
gradientTimeBar => Apply a smooth gradient color effect to the time progress bar.
customColor => Use custom colors for UI elements instead of default theme colors.
luaDebugPrint => Show the debug output printed by Lua scripts on screen.
hitErrorBarVisible => Display a visual bar showing your note hit timing errors.
hitBarLines => Number of indicator lines shown on the hit error bar.
hitBarLineTime => Duration in seconds for each line to stay visible on the hit bar.
hitErrorBarOffsetX => Adjust the horizontal position of the hit error bar.
hitErrorBarOffsetY => Adjust the vertical position of the hit error bar.
msInErrorBar => Show the current timing error in milliseconds directly on the hit error bar.
pointerType => Choose the shape of the pointer on the hit error bar.
guideLineAlpha => Control the opacity (transparency) of the guide lines.
noteOffsetChangingAllowed => Apply the note offset recorded in the replay when playing it back.